## Overview
Create a site that copies the given design from:
https://www.frontendmentor.io/learning-paths/getting-started-on-frontend-mentor-XJhRWRREZd/challenge/65e6f48617e502f0b6ca3cfe/start

### Screenshot
images\finished_site.png

## My process
Started with setting background colour
Then uploaded the image from the image folder
Created the white box behind the image, using CSS to format it correctly
Added text, formatted the box and text to fit correctly
Added view for phone use.

### Built with
- Notepad++
- HTML/CSS
- Google for various code referencing (#Useful Recources)

### What I learned
How to center objects on a page.
How to insert images from a folder.

